### Necessário para pegar o token
### Post
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

###

### sem token
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllClientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

###

### token inválido
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllClientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

###

### dados inválidos
POST http://localhost:40000/insertCliente HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "",
    "email": "nao-e-email",
    "telefone": ""
}

###

### teste de inserção de cliente
POST http://localhost:40000/insertCliente HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Carlos Matias",
    "email": "carlos.matias@example.com",
    "telefone": "(17) 97777-0003"
}

###

### teste de buscar todos os clientes
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllClientes HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getClienteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### ID inexistente
GET http://localhost:40000/getClienteByID/999999 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### teste de atualização de cliente
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateCliente/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Ana Lima Atualizada",
    "email": "ana.lima@example.com",
    "telefone": "(17) 99999-0001"
}

###

### teste de exclusão lógica
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteCliente/3 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### registro já removido ou inexistente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteCliente/999999 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
